Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=2}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 50,0:01:32.71,0:01:34.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, I get it now.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:34.50,0:01:36.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're gonna turn into\Nyour Sulong form
Dialogue: 50,0:01:36.79,0:01:40.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and go berserk once\Nyou gaze at the moon.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:53.43,0:01:54.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's Jack!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:00.27,0:02:03.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You put together\Na hell of a plan, didn't you?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:03.52,0:02:06.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But that doesn't mean\Nyou're strong enough to win.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:06.44,0:02:09.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just that we were careless.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:09.03,0:02:12.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You won't lay another\Nfinger on Kaido!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:12.03,0:02:14.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm about to dye this snow\Nred with your blood!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:18.24,0:02:20.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold your swords. One moment.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:21.32,0:02:21.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jack devastated our\Nthousand-year-old kingdom
Dialogue: 50,0:02:21.46,0:02:23.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jack devastated our\Nthousand-year-old kingdom
Dialogue: 50,0:02:23.75,0:02:23.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and tormented our people.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:23.99,0:02:25.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and tormented our people.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:25.25,0:02:25.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That man is our sworn enemy.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:25.57,0:02:27.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That man is our sworn enemy.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:27.34,0:02:29.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We turned him away\Ncountless times,
Dialogue: 50,0:02:29.30,0:02:31.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but he would not relent.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:31.47,0:02:34.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The warrior you were\Nsearching for is right here!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:34.27,0:02:36.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It is I!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:38.31,0:02:40.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I owe the Minks my life!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:40.11,0:02:42.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Every cruelty you committed\Nshall be punished
Dialogue: 50,0:02:42.40,0:02:44.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,with the force of my fury!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:58.40,0:02:59.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please, allow us.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:59.90,0:03:02.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Save your power for Kaido.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:02.32,0:03:04.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You-gara as well.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:18.46,0:03:20.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right. Then best of luck.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:20.92,0:03:22.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm grateful.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:22.63,0:03:25.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I promise you-gara\Nthat I will show Kaido
Dialogue: 50,0:03:25.51,0:03:27.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,every ounce of my strength.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:36.47,0:04:39.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, they can't\Nmaintain that form for long.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:39.97,0:04:43.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, bring it on!\NWe're beasts, too, you know!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:09.41,0:05:13.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You think that rat bastard Jack\Nwent outside with them, too?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:13.58,0:05:16.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Unlike you, he's\Nconsiderate enough to leave.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:17.98,0:05:21.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Excuse me?\NWhat was that?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:21.04,0:05:26.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you've got a problem with me,\Njust say so, Punkass.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:52.68,0:05:56.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:02.36,0:06:04.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your plan was solid in theory.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:04.69,0:06:08.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But the execution was\Nlacking, to say the least.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:19.39,0:06:21.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shinobu!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:25.73,0:06:26.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shinobu!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:29.13,0:06:33.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:33.22,0:06:35.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shinobu!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:35.56,0:06:40.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lord Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:40.64,0:06:43.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I passed out for\Na moment. How shameful.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:43.48,0:06:45.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, away!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:55.49,0:06:57.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:58.04,0:07:00.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How the hell is he flying?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:00.62,0:07:01.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And why is he so bad at it?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:06.14,0:07:12.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm too high up! It's scary!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:14.93,0:07:16.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's floating through the air!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:16.93,0:07:22.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What sorcery is this?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:24.23,0:07:28.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,On behalf of the\Ncommander, I shall execute you!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:46.23,0:07:49.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't see a damn thing!\NHow's he doing that?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:02.63,0:08:04.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just in time!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:04.01,0:08:10.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's Sanji! Let's go!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:11.13,0:08:12.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hand over the boy.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:12.93,0:08:13.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He and the Kozuki name\Nmust be erased from this world
Dialogue: 50,0:08:13.97,0:08:15.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to retire from this\Nworld once and for all.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:15.64,0:08:17.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,once and for all.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:33.94,0:08:34.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't worry!\NI've got you, my lord!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:34.30,0:08:37.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't worry!\NI've got you, my lord!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:42.20,0:08:42.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Momo! Nice speech earlier!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:42.31,0:08:46.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Momo! Nice speech earlier!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:46.56,0:08:46.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You were badass.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:46.66,0:08:48.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You were badass.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:48.09,0:08:51.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I did my best!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:51.64,0:08:54.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right, Shinobu!\NKeep him safe!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:54.85,0:08:56.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Understood!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:56.56,0:08:59.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sangoro, I shall repay you!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:04.86,0:09:05.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, whoa!\NHold up, my guy!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:05.17,0:09:06.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't
Dialogue: 50,0:09:08.50,0:09:12.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,losing\Nend here! Knock it off!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:14.49,0:09:17.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn it, you bird bastard!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:18.12,0:09:20.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're gonna leave\Na gigantic hole in my torso
Dialogue: 50,0:09:20.37,0:09:22.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,if you keep this up!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:22.42,0:09:25.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,More than just that,\NI'll rip you in two!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:25.92,0:09:29.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you're so scared,\Nwhy don't you disappear again?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:29.59,0:09:32.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This might be hard for\Nyour bird brain to comprehend,
Dialogue: 50,0:09:32.34,0:09:33.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but it's just a trick.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:33.68,0:09:35.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lemme go, damn it!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:35.10,0:09:36.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Say goodbye.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:48.79,0:09:53.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That attack was crazy.\NI think Sanji needs my help.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:53.00,0:09:55.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yomato! Be back in a sec!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:55.46,0:09:57.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Keep an eye on Momo for me!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:57.38,0:09:58.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:58.76,0:10:00.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why wouldn't it be okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:00.89,0:10:03.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh, right! You have a point!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:03.51,0:10:06.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He... He is my son after all!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:08.60,0:10:09.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then hurry it up!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:09.90,0:10:11.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:11.65,0:10:12.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That boy will be protected
Dialogue: 50,0:10:12.86,0:10:15.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,because that's what\Ngood parents do!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:15.11,0:10:16.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! I'm not done with you!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:16.86,0:10:18.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait for me, Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:18.49,0:10:19.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your father is on his way!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:19.74,0:10:21.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait! Stop running away from me!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:21.62,0:10:26.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not so fast, you!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:28.34,0:10:31.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on out and help Mama!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:31.05,0:10:33.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The sooner we get\Nrid of these samurai,
Dialogue: 50,0:10:33.26,0:10:35.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the sooner the feast can begin!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:35.72,0:10:38.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys want that, don't you?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:42.65,0:10:44.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's time to pay!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:44.57,0:10:45.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Remember the wedding?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:45.98,0:10:47.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The tea party?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:47.07,0:10:48.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And now this banquet!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:48.99,0:10:51.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've managed to\Ndestroy everything
Dialogue: 50,0:10:51.07,0:10:52.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've looked forward to!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:53.44,0:10:59.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am going to destroy\Nyou in a spectacular fashion!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:59.19,0:11:04.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You will die\Nlike the worm you are!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:08.50,0:11:10.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:29.18,0:11:34.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:40.32,0:11:42.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That crone is too powerful\Nfor her own good.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:42.99,0:11:44.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,From the stories I've heard,
Dialogue: 50,0:11:44.32,0:11:46.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,she's not someone\Nwe should take lightly.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:46.32,0:11:49.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's a pirate captain\Nevery bit as fearsome as Kaido!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:49.50,0:11:52.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seriously? But if we\Ncan't handle one guy,
Dialogue: 50,0:11:52.37,0:11:54.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,how are we supposed to\Nhandle two of 'em, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:55.92,0:11:58.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I need to ditch her so I\Ncan help Momo and Sanji!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:58.46,0:12:00.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If I go to them, she'll follow,
Dialogue: 50,0:12:00.38,0:12:03.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and the last thing I wanna do\Nis put them in more danger.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:03.47,0:12:06.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Goodness, you're\Nrather slippery, aren't you?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:06.68,0:12:13.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You scurried right out\Nof the way. Oh, Zeus?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:13.56,0:12:16.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmm? Hm?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:16.31,0:12:19.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Zeus! Where are you?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:19.15,0:12:20.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:20.90,0:12:22.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's time to go!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:22.17,0:12:23.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh, please, Nami,\Nwhat are you are doing?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:23.44,0:12:23.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've seen first-hand\Nhow mad Mama can get!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:23.71,0:12:25.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've seen first-hand\Nhow mad Mama can get!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:25.61,0:12:26.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's gonna murder us!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:26.13,0:12:27.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's gonna murder us!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:27.59,0:12:29.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll have to punish you.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:31.26,0:12:34.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, let's get this\Nthing over with!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:34.59,0:12:37.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, Mama... 
Dialogue: 50,0:12:37.34,0:12:40.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! You wanna\Nescape with your life
Dialogue: 50,0:12:40.22,0:12:42.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,or have Big Mom kill you?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:42.18,0:12:45.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? But I can't\Ngo against Big Mom!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:45.44,0:12:48.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That is enough!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:53.57,0:12:57.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:57.41,0:13:03.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give him back,\Nyou little cat burglar!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:04.46,0:13:06.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please find it in your\Nheart to forgive me!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:06.96,0:13:10.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's all my fault.\NI really messed up, Mama!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:10.84,0:13:14.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I should have never\Ndisobeyed you!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:14.39,0:13:19.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Honey, it's all right.\NCome back home.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:19.14,0:13:22.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can make it up to me\Nby taking out this little tramp!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:22.81,0:13:25.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's the only way\Nyou can earn my trust!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:26.51,0:13:26.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I will do anything\Nfor you! Just say it!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:26.54,0:13:29.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I will do anything\Nfor you! Just say it!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:29.17,0:13:29.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You want me to cut ties\Nwith her? It's a done deal!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:29.36,0:13:30.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You want me to\Ncut ties with her?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:30.90,0:13:32.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a done deal!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:32.26,0:13:32.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's what I like to hear.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:32.45,0:13:34.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's what I like to hear.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:34.63,0:13:34.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now go and make\Nyour Mama proud.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:34.86,0:13:38.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, go and make\Nyour Mama proud!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:38.88,0:13:38.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,♪ Sakura! Dun-dun-dun! ♪
Dialogue: 50,0:13:38.96,0:13:39.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,♪ \NSakura! Dun-dun-dun! ♪
Dialogue: 50,0:13:39.81,0:13:42.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,♪ Dun, dun, dun, dun! Yeah! ♪
Dialogue: 50,0:13:41.83,0:13:45.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}♪ The time? It's flown away. ♪
Dialogue: 50,0:13:45.75,0:13:47.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}♪ I'm like the wind. ♪
Dialogue: 50,0:13:47.71,0:13:49.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,150)}♪ Dun, dun! ♪
Dialogue: 50,0:13:50.96,0:13:51.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've only got one chance\Nto make this right!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:51.10,0:13:54.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've only got one\Nchance to make this right!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:54.26,0:13:54.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you screw this up,\Nyou're done for!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:54.26,0:13:56.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you screw this up,\Nyou're done for!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:58.22,0:13:59.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:59.76,0:14:06.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Soul Sensor Activate!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:06.16,0:14:06.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am really sorry, Nami!\NBeen nice knowing you and all!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:06.36,0:14:09.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am really sorry, Nami!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:09.32,0:14:11.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Been nice knowing you and all!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:11.58,0:14:11.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You pathetic little coward!\NI am so over you!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:11.74,0:14:16.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You pathetic little coward!\NI am so over you!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:19.04,0:14:19.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Somebody help me!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:19.12,0:14:22.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Somebody help me!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:22.12,0:14:23.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,♪ My brother? ♪
Dialogue: 50,0:14:23.50,0:14:27.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}♪ I'm by his side,\Nlike a bird we will fly. ♪
Dialogue: 50,0:14:27.54,0:14:33.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\fad(150,150)}– ♪ Saying goodbye, soaring so high, ♪\N– ♪ Saying goodbye, soaring so high, ♪
Dialogue: 50,0:14:33.42,0:14:36.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)}♪ you'll hear our cry! ♪
Dialogue: 50,0:14:37.33,0:14:40.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,150)}♪ I'm a tough guy! ♪
Dialogue: 50,0:14:40.35,0:14:40.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,♪ Born to be free!\NGo-go Franky! ♪
Dialogue: 50,0:14:40.40,0:14:47.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}♪ Born to be free!\NGo-go Franky! ♪
Dialogue: 50,0:15:00.20,0:15:04.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rain, rain go away.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:13.55,0:15:13.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoops! I think\NI hit something back there.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:13.64,0:15:17.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoops! I think\NI hit something back there.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:20.43,0:15:20.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No biggie. As long as\Nit wasn't a pretty flower.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:20.53,0:15:25.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No biggie. As long as it\Nwasn't a pretty flower.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:28.23,0:15:31.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Big Bro!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:34.09,0:15:36.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mama! Wake up!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:36.18,0:15:36.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is about to get ugly,\Nreal fast! 
Dialogue: 50,0:15:36.55,0:15:38.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're doomed!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:43.73,0:15:44.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's gonna flip out!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:44.10,0:15:45.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He hit her straight in the face!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:51.73,0:15:56.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Big bro! 
Dialogue: 50,0:15:56.53,0:15:58.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you! You're the best!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:58.65,0:16:02.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you-teia okay?\NThat was crazy!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:02.03,0:16:04.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it was crazy awesome!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:04.20,0:16:06.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky's here!\NWe got this under control!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:08.08,0:16:10.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Forward! Show 'em\Nwhat you've got!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:16.79,0:16:18.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guess we missed the kickoff.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:18.97,0:16:20.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:20.64,0:16:24.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That was quite the entrance\Nthey made, but I have a plan.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:24.39,0:16:25.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can you help out?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:25.69,0:16:29.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course! This should be fun.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:29.61,0:16:30.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wow, nice.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:30.98,0:16:33.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It looks like they've\Ngot things covered for now.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:33.57,0:16:35.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right, up I go.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:35.86,0:16:41.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Time to help Kin'emon!\NI'm ready!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:43.38,0:16:45.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There you are!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:47.43,0:16:49.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad I found you!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:49.64,0:16:51.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kozuki Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:54.14,0:16:55.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And who are you?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:00.44,0:17:02.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:02.69,0:17:04.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Shinobu!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:05.57,0:17:07.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, he's our friend.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:07.74,0:17:09.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's gonna help you guys out.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:09.36,0:17:11.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? An ally?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:14.74,0:17:18.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's safer to be with\Nhim than to be by yourselves.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:20.21,0:17:21.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:25.00,0:17:26.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're a friend of Sir Luffy?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:26.92,0:17:31.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:31.93,0:17:34.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, good. Then I'll trust you.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:34.72,0:17:36.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is your name?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:40.19,0:17:43.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Glad you asked!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:46.61,0:17:51.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My name is Kozuki Oden!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:51.74,0:17:56.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And I shall protect you!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:56.87,0:17:59.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're my father?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:59.29,0:18:01.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lord Oden?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:07.96,0:18:11.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold on. 
Dialogue: 50,0:18:11.05,0:18:14.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You have breasts. And horns!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:14.14,0:18:16.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why, you're not\Nmy father at all!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:16.93,0:18:18.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is highly suspicious!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:18.77,0:18:20.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You must be our foe!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:20.31,0:18:23.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:23.73,0:18:25.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Smoke Escape Jutsu!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:25.44,0:18:29.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait!\NWhy are you running away?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:41.25,0:18:43.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's too many of them.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:43.17,0:18:45.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We just keep\Ngetting bogged down.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:45.08,0:18:46.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, you're right.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:46.75,0:18:48.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no point in\Nfighting these small fries.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:48.96,0:18:50.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We need a change of plans.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:50.38,0:18:52.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What about the Tobi Roppo?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:52.30,0:18:55.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those dinosaur people\Nthat Denjiro mentioned?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:55.22,0:18:58.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Might turn the tide if we\Ncould kill some of them.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:58.06,0:19:00.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maybe that's a bit optimistic...
Dialogue: 50,0:19:01.81,0:19:05.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But even if we can't win,\Nwe can still stall them!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:06.08,0:19:08.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, you brutes!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:08.04,0:19:11.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It takes some nerve\Nto run me over!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:11.46,0:19:13.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Big Mom is about to go berserk!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:28.79,0:19:34.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look at all the\NStraw Hats ling up.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:34.04,0:19:36.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you ready to get crushed?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:40.20,0:19:44.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hello, Soul King!\NIt's been quite a while.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:44.28,0:19:47.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If nothing else,\NI applaud your captain
Dialogue: 50,0:19:47.08,0:19:50.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,for gathering so many\Nunique creatures.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:50.80,0:19:52.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yoho! I see you're\Na woman of taste!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:52.68,0:19:56.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh. Yeah? You like\Nmy iron body, old hag?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:56.48,0:19:58.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:58.65,0:20:04.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then I'll give you\Na demonstration!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:04.53,0:20:09.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cyborg power! Can ya dig it?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:12.83,0:20:15.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm one of a kind, baby!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:15.46,0:20:17.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky, stop! Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:17.92,0:20:21.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's an Emperor! We gotta run!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:21.21,0:20:23.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:23.67,0:20:27.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do we run from Emperors?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:27.88,0:20:29.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I dunno.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:29.56,0:20:36.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guess we could,\Nbut what about our captain?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:36.40,0:20:39.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You want him to\Nbecome King of the Pirates.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:39.10,0:20:41.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't you, Nami?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:54.08,0:20:59.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}...Radical Beam!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:59.54,0:21:00.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:00.63,0:21:02.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yikes! They're huge!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:02.88,0:21:08.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What in the world are they?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:08.76,0:21:10.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, buzz off!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:10.51,0:21:14.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you're gonna go wild,\Nstay in your own banquet hall!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:14.64,0:21:17.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stupid Numbers!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:22.48,0:21:24.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:24.40,0:21:28.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're as big as Oars!\NThey're monsters!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:29.78,0:21:32.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm getting mad flashbacks\Nfrom Thriller Bark.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:35.95,0:21:37.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fancy that!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:37.37,0:21:39.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those must be\NCaesar's failed attempts
Dialogue: 50,0:21:39.62,0:21:41.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,at recreating ancient Giants.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:41.84,0:21:45.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No use to me, but it would\Nseem that Kaido uses them!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:49.72,0:21:53.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is he grabbing\Nwhat I think he's grabbing?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:53.28,0:21:55.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Brachio Tank!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:55.12,0:21:57.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp and Chopper are in there!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:57.27,0:21:57.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, monster face!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:57.52,0:22:04.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Put that down\Nor I'm gonna make you!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:04.24,0:22:08.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Franky...
Dialogue: 50,0:22:08.16,0:22:12.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}...Radical...
Dialogue: 50,0:22:12.70,0:22:17.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}...Beam!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:17.58,0:22:20.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jaki!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:30.26,0:22:35.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now that my lasers are\Nupgraded, I'm unstoppable.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:35.44,0:22:42.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, you should've\Nsaved that attack for me.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:39.93,0:22:46.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's too late now, iron man.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:48.71,0:22:50.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your hand, madam.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:51.38,0:22:53.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Fish-Man Jiu-Jitsu!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:53.11,0:22:54.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,150)}Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:56.57,0:23:00.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mil Fleurs!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:00.97,0:23:06.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Whirlpool Shoulder Throw!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:10.73,0:23:15.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}And Delphinium!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:17.11,0:23:20.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I haven't forgotten\Nwhat you did to my fleet!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:20.53,0:23:23.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you, too, soon enough!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:30.39,0:23:32.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha. Good luck.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:36.17,0:23:38.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nice plan!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:41.24,0:23:42.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Went better\Nthan expected!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:42.93,0:23:45.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She'll be even angrier\Nwhen she gets back.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:47.56,0:23:50.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You are quite a\Nremarkable woman.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:50.53,0:23:53.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good job! Thanks for the assist!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:53.79,0:23:55.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I coulda been scrap metal!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:55.66,0:23:59.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then I'm\Nglad we made it in time!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:59.50,0:24:01.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And now...
Dialogue: 50,0:24:05.92,0:24:08.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The moment you've\Nall been waiting for.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:18.06,0:24:21.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Commander Chopper!\NGot a status report for me?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:21.19,0:24:24.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp! Wake up!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:24.57,0:24:26.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp! Pull it together!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:26.53,0:24:29.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're getting a call\Nfrom Franky! C'mon!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:29.28,0:24:30.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! What's gives?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:30.74,0:24:32.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You good in there?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:32.32,0:24:39.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh... Yep, couldn't fell better,\Nthanks to the Brachio Tank.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:39.16,0:24:43.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You remember our promise, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:43.17,0:24:45.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Our promise"?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:45.30,0:24:47.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We were gonna combine!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:47.46,0:24:50.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Iron Pirate, bro!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:50.26,0:24:52.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Docking time, baby!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:52.34,0:24:53.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iron.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:53.80,0:24:56.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Pirate?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:07.23,0:25:09.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good. I can see the sky.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:09.31,0:25:13.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay. I think I can\Nmake it up from here.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:13.90,0:25:14.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not so fast!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:16.15,0:25:17.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh, Master Queen!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:17.32,0:25:19.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go away, I'm taking a break.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:19.95,0:25:21.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But it's Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:21.91,0:25:26.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? What?! He's here?!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:26.41,0:25:28.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And who the hell is that?!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:28.65,0:25:28.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey there, Zoro!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:28.79,0:25:30.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey there, Zoro!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:30.24,0:25:30.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, look who it is!\NWhere are you headed?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:30.33,0:25:33.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, look who it is.\NWhere are you headed?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:33.20,0:25:33.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Up to fight Kaido!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:33.42,0:25:35.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Up to fight Kaido!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:35.78,0:25:35.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm coming with you.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:35.80,0:25:37.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm coming with you.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:37.46,0:25:41.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're not getting away!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:47.31,0:25:51.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell\Nis that thing? It's huge!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:51.98,0:25:53.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ready?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:53.91,0:25:59.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gum-Gum Rocket!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:02.32,0:26:03.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good! We got this.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:03.82,0:26:05.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You said Kaido's up there?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:05.53,0:26:06.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I think he\Nstarted fighting
Dialogue: 50,0:26:06.99,0:26:09.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,with Kin'emon's group already!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:09.29,0:26:11.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just a little more!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:19.41,0:26:19.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:19.70,0:26:20.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You ain't goin'\Nnowhere on my watch!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:20.94,0:26:21.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You ain't goin'\Nnowhere on my watch.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:21.18,0:26:22.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:26.94,0:26:27.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give up. I control these skies!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:27.17,0:26:29.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give up. I control these skies!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:32.78,0:26:32.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're never gonna make it
Dialogue: 50,0:26:32.84,0:26:34.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're never gonna make it
Dialogue: 50,0:26:34.37,0:26:34.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,with these bastards hounding us!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:34.47,0:26:35.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,with these bastards hounding us!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:35.70,0:26:35.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I didn't think they'd be\Nguarding the roof! 
Dialogue: 50,0:26:35.76,0:26:38.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I didn't think they'd\Nbe guarding the roof!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:01.56,0:27:04.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah. That's what I'm\Ntalkin' about!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:04.27,0:27:06.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's do it!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:07.44,0:27:09.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\fad(150,0)}– Docking formation!\N– Docking formation!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:09.86,0:27:12.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,150)}Ready to combine!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:19.46,0:27:23.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Black Rhino, standing by!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:23.29,0:27:25.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\fad(150,0)}– Brachio Head, activate!\N– Brachio Head, activate!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:25.42,0:27:26.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,150)}Let's do this!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:28.92,0:27:31.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry, bros,\Nit's only got one seat!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:31.88,0:27:33.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:33.55,0:27:36.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is a betrayal!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:36.01,0:27:37.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who's that up there?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:37.26,0:27:40.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's Usohachi!\NAnd Choppereamon!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:40.02,0:27:41.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you two all right?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:41.68,0:27:42.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Back at the Pleasure Hall,
Dialogue: 50,0:27:42.94,0:27:45.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you guys really stuck\Nyour necks out for us!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:45.23,0:27:46.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We really owe you one!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:46.94,0:27:49.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure! But you can\Nthank us later!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:49.78,0:27:51.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, later!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:51.07,0:27:54.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right now, there's a robot\Nthat you gotta see!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:21.30,0:28:24.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's rock!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:27.22,0:28:29.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then why do you have\Na giant robot?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:38.56,0:28:40.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He took out Jaki fast!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:40.23,0:28:42.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That thing is bad news!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:42.19,0:28:44.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's move!\NWe'll just get stomped!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:44.28,0:28:46.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:51.41,0:28:53.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momo...
Dialogue: 50,0:28:53.79,0:28:55.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I hope he got away.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:00.65,0:29:02.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:02.94,0:29:05.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This just tickles my funny bone.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:05.20,0:29:06.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look around us!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:06.74,0:29:07.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're outnumbered,\Nenemies on every side.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:07.06,0:29:10.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're outnumbered.\NEnemies on every side.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:10.49,0:29:10.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And yet, for some reason,\NI feel like we can't be beat.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:10.82,0:29:15.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And yet for some reason,\NI feel like we can't be beat.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:15.16,0:29:15.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're damn right!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:15.36,0:29:16.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're damn right.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:16.42,0:29:16.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought the same thing.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:16.70,0:29:18.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought the same thing.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:18.04,0:29:18.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wonder why?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:18.37,0:29:19.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wonder why. Where does\Nthis courage come from?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:19.17,0:29:21.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where does this\Ncourage come from?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:21.34,0:29:21.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When you put it that way
Dialogue: 50,0:29:21.54,0:29:23.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When you put it that way,
Dialogue: 50,0:29:23.21,0:29:23.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I suppose we have Mister\NStraw Hat to thank, don't we?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:23.54,0:29:27.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I suppose we have Mister\NStraw Hat to thank, don't we?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:29.76,0:29:32.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Looks like I won't be able\Nto jump up there after all.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:32.85,0:29:35.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I guess, I need a new plan.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:35.48,0:29:37.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've got your back, Captain.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:37.94,0:29:42.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've got me. Let's head up.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:42.73,0:29:44.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is a damn pain.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:44.94,0:29:46.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bastards were ready.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:46.20,0:29:48.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They got the whole\Nswarm up there!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:48.20,0:29:50.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They'll be nothing\Nbut caterpillars
Dialogue: 50,0:29:50.03,0:29:51.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,once we tear off their wings.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:51.78,0:29:53.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I get the sentiment,\Nbut do you have to be
Dialogue: 50,0:29:53.54,0:29:55.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so creepy about it?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:57.08,0:29:58.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I suppose those dinosaurs
Dialogue: 50,0:29:58.46,0:30:01.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,are the fabled\N"Lead Performers"?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:04.63,0:30:06.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They look pretty tough,
Dialogue: 50,0:30:06.26,0:30:09.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but I'm not worried\N'cuz our captain's stronger!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:09.01,0:30:10.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:10.26,0:30:12.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And as navigator,\Nit's my duty to help him
Dialogue: 50,0:30:12.85,0:30:15.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,get wherever he needs to go!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:18.56,0:30:20.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't sweat a thing, brother.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:20.27,0:30:22.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,General Franky's gonna\Nclear out those thugs
Dialogue: 50,0:30:22.40,0:30:24.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,before you can say "super"!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:26.38,0:30:26.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everyone's ready, Captain!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:26.90,0:30:29.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everyone's ready, Captain!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:30.80,0:30:31.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right! Time for round two!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:31.32,0:30:33.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right! Time for round two!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:33.09,0:30:33.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's do it!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:33.66,0:30:34.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's do it!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:34.76,0:30:35.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Samurai! Don't give 'em an inch!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:35.29,0:30:37.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Samurai! Don't give 'em an inch!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:37.89,0:30:38.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're counting on you!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:38.37,0:30:40.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're counting on you!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:54.70,0:30:55.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You better get ready, Kaido,\N'cause I'm coming for you.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:55.18,0:30:58.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You better get ready, Kaido.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:58.10,0:31:00.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Cause I'm coming for ya.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=3}===============================DIALOGUE============================
